{"4885460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashes of the Crown", "steam_appid": 4885460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras/750c8e944c75d0b80b677a69bdf48982.avif?t=1787682436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras_big/750c8e944c75d0b80b677a69bdf48982.avif?t=1787682436 width=1560 height=584 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of the Crown</strong> is an open-world action RPG and RTS base-defense hybrid where you fight alongside your growing settlement. Take direct control of your hero while building, expanding, and defending a survivor camp against relentless enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous open world to gather resources, recruit survivors, discover new locations, and uncover valuable loot. Every decision matters—invest in your economy, strengthen your defenses, or venture beyond the safety of your walls in search of better equipment and rare materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the enemy grows stronger, balancing exploration, combat, and settlement management becomes the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras/1c9b6c4a9265bfb4151aafe6d443e97d.avif?t=1787682436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras_big/1c9b6c4a9265bfb4151aafe6d443e97d.avif?t=1787682436 width=1560 height=584 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Hero Combat</strong> – Fight enemies in real time using melee and ranged weapons, discover loot, and grow stronger through character progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Expand Your Settlement</strong> – Construct houses, resource buildings, storage, workshops, and defensive structures while assigning workers to keep your settlement thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras/ad28a19404f1b926b09b1d67f18b2996.avif?t=1787682436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras_big/ad28a19404f1b926b09b1d67f18b2996.avif?t=1787682436 width=1560 height=584 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather &amp; Manage Resources</strong> – Collect materials, optimize production, and make strategic decisions to prepare for increasingly dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras/81e0d63e5963646bc7970c7bc5f05c8e.avif?t=1787682436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras_big/81e0d63e5963646bc7970c7bc5f05c8e.avif?t=1787682436 width=1560 height=584 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Against Enemy Waves</strong> – Face relentless assaults that challenge both your combat skills and the strength of your settlement's defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Open World</strong> – Venture beyond your walls, follow branching paths, discover new locations, uncover resources, and secure the future of your people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Strategy</strong> – Focus on building an efficient settlement, mastering direct combat, exploring the world, or finding the perfect balance between them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough presents new strategic choices in the fight for survival.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras/750c8e944c75d0b80b677a69bdf48982.avif?t=1787682436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras_big/750c8e944c75d0b80b677a69bdf48982.avif?t=1787682436 width=1560 height=584 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of the Crown</strong> is an open-world action RPG and RTS base-defense hybrid where you fight alongside your growing settlement. Take direct control of your hero while building, expanding, and defending a survivor camp against relentless enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous open world to gather resources, recruit survivors, discover new locations, and uncover valuable loot. Every decision matters—invest in your economy, strengthen your defenses, or venture beyond the safety of your walls in search of better equipment and rare materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the enemy grows stronger, balancing exploration, combat, and settlement management becomes the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras/1c9b6c4a9265bfb4151aafe6d443e97d.avif?t=1787682436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras_big/1c9b6c4a9265bfb4151aafe6d443e97d.avif?t=1787682436 width=1560 height=584 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Hero Combat</strong> – Fight enemies in real time using melee and ranged weapons, discover loot, and grow stronger through character progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Expand Your Settlement</strong> – Construct houses, resource buildings, storage, workshops, and defensive structures while assigning workers to keep your settlement thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras/ad28a19404f1b926b09b1d67f18b2996.avif?t=1787682436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras_big/ad28a19404f1b926b09b1d67f18b2996.avif?t=1787682436 width=1560 height=584 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather &amp; Manage Resources</strong> – Collect materials, optimize production, and make strategic decisions to prepare for increasingly dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras/81e0d63e5963646bc7970c7bc5f05c8e.avif?t=1787682436\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885460/extras_big/81e0d63e5963646bc7970c7bc5f05c8e.avif?t=1787682436 width=1560 height=584 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Against Enemy Waves</strong> – Face relentless assaults that challenge both your combat skills and the strength of your settlement's defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Open World</strong> – Venture beyond your walls, follow branching paths, discover new locations, uncover resources, and secure the future of your people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Strategy</strong> – Focus on building an efficient settlement, mastering direct combat, exploring the world, or finding the perfect balance between them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough presents new strategic choices in the fight for survival.</p>", "short_description": "Build a survivor camp, gather resources, craft defenses, and fight as a hero in this singleplayer of an action-RPG RTS